# Workspace Boundaries

- Treat `team/**` and `external/**` as strictly read-only.
- Treat `notes/**` as read-only unless the user explicitly requests an edit.
- Never reuse an earlier exception to a protected-path rule.
- Put daily project work in `work/projects/<project>/sessions/`.
- Put unclassified work in `work/inbox/`.
- Put validated reusable knowledge in `knowledge/`.
- Put MVP and MARBLE execution data in `compute/`, not beside source documents.
- Read the root `AGENTS.md` before making changes.
